# ── Genjutsu generation: pick ONE ────────────────────────────────────────────
# A) REST API (memegen render does everything). Create a key at https://console.higgsfield.ai
#    and paste it as "KEY_ID:KEY_SECRET". Pay-as-you-go API balance.
HF_KEY=
# B) Higgsfield MCP connector (uses your higgsfield.ai subscription credits): leave HF_KEY empty and
#    connect https://mcp.higgsfield.ai/mcp in Claude — see README "API 연결".

# ── The one cost question ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Answer it once for every meme and never be asked again: probe-first | full | prep-only
# MEMEGEN_RUN_PLAN=probe-first

# ── Image generation (only for looks / new views) ────────────────────────────
# Runs through the Codex CLI (`codex login` with ChatGPT; no API key needed).
# MEMEGEN_CODEX_BIN=codex
# MEMEGEN_CODEX_MODEL=
